## 7. Constraints and Risks

### Technical Constraints
- Compatibility with older hardware may limit game performance.
- Cross-platform play may introduce complex challenges in matchmaking.

### Market Risks
- Competition from established franchises such as Fortnite by Epic Games and Call of Duty by Activision Blizzard.
- Changing consumer preferences towards gaming experiences.

### Legal and Regulatory Compliance
- Adherence to COPPA for child protection in gaming.
- GDPR compliance for data protection and user privacy in the EU.

